# WH-1000XM5 Equalizer curve edits on real hardware, continuing
# real-equalizer-presets in the same link session, on Excited. Each edit sends
# Manual's whole curve. The Device notifies only an edit that moves it onto
# Manual from another Preset. An edit already on Manual is only ACKed, though
# the Device takes it: picking Off then Manual again notifies the edited curve,
# and real-equalizer-kept shows the last one kept. Recorded before the app read
# a curve back after its ACK, so the app's frames here lack those reads.
